[2026-03-04T19:18:53.320Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BfqZ7jf5zQwLf873KrvHKJ","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Skill\n     2→\n     3→You are building an application based on the provided AppSpec.md.\n     4→If `AppRevisions.md` exists, it describes new functionality and spec changes organized by topic section, and must also be followed.\n     5→`AppSpec.md` must NEVER be modified. All spec changes go in `AppRevisions.md`.\n     6→You will build the app in the following stages, with task skill files in `skills/tasks/build/` for additional instructions.\n     7→\n     8→1. testSpec.md: Create a detailed test specification for the tests the app must pass in order to match the app spec.\n     9→\n    10→2. writeShared.md: Write or refactor code which the app needs and that can be shared with other apps.\n    11→\n    12→3. writeApp.md: Write the app's code according to the two specs.\n    13→\n    14→4. writeScript.md: For each design doc in `skills/scripts/`, implement the script.\n    15→\n    16→5. writeTests.md: Write the tests according to the two specs.\n    17→\n    18→6. testing.md: Get all tests to pass, debugging and fixing the app / tests as needed.\n    19→\n    20→7. deployment.md: Deploy the app to production.\n    21→\n    22→Add tasks to the queue for each stage in **reverse order** (last stage first), since\n    23→`add-task` always pushes to the front:\n    24→\n    25→```\n    26→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Deploy to production\"\n    27→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/testing.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Get all tests passing\"\n    28→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/writeTests.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write Playwright tests\"\n    29→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/writeScript.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Implement package scripts\"\n    30→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/writeApp.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write the app\"\n    31→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/writeShared.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write app shared code\"\n    32→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/testSpec.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write test specification\"\n    33→```\n    34→\n    35→The worker will pick up and process each task in order (testSpec → writeShared → writeApp → writeScript → writeTests → testing → deployment).\n    36→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f12ad60-a107-40df-a042-b56785f1253f","uuid":"78030ac5-595a-43a1-bb85-9860f4b464b3","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/skills/messages/buildInitialApp.md","content":"# Skill\n\nYou are building an application based on the provided AppSpec.md.\nIf `AppRevisions.md` exists, it describes new functionality and spec changes organized by topic section, and must also be followed.\n`AppSpec.md` must NEVER be modified. All spec changes go in `AppRevisions.md`.\nYou will build the app in the following stages, with task skill files in `skills/tasks/build/` for additional instructions.\n\n1. testSpec.md: Create a detailed test specification for the tests the app must pass in order to match the app spec.\n\n2. writeShared.md: Write or refactor code which the app needs and that can be shared with other apps.\n\n3. writeApp.md: Write the app's code according to the two specs.\n\n4. writeScript.md: For each design doc in `skills/scripts/`, implement the script.\n\n5. writeTests.md: Write the tests according to the two specs.\n\n6. testing.md: Get all tests to pass, debugging and fixing the app / tests as needed.\n\n7. deployment.md: Deploy the app to production.\n\nAdd tasks to the queue for each stage in **reverse order** (last stage first), since\n`add-task` always pushes to the front:\n\n```\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Deploy to production\"\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/testing.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Get all tests passing\"\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/writeTests.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write Playwright tests\"\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/writeScript.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Implement package scripts\"\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/writeApp.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write the app\"\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/writeShared.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write app shared code\"\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts --skill \"skills/tasks/build/testSpec.md\" --app \"<AppName>\" --subtask \"Unpack: Write test specification\"\n```\n\nThe worker will pick up and process each task in order (testSpec → writeShared → writeApp → writeScript → writeTests → testing → deployment).\n","numLines":36,"startLine":1,"totalLines":36}}}
